    {
      "text": "From its rear, it sprays a foul-smelling liquid at opponents. It aims for their faces, and it can hit them from over 16 feet away.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it lifts its tail and points its rear at you, beware. It’s about to spray you with a fluid stinky enough to make you faint.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "The poison that gushes from its aft end is accompanied by an utterly evil-smelling odor with such potency that one whiff can induce memory loss.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
